:0;vertical-align:top;\x22\x3e\x3c/svg\x3e\x3c/section\x3e\x3c/section\x3e\x3c/section\x3e\x3csection style=\x22display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;border-radius: 19px;overflow: hidden;min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;background-color: rgb(28, 142, 171);padding: 8px 13px;border-style: solid;border-width: 2px;border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\x22\x3e\x3csection style=\x22text-align: justify;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.2;box-sizing: border-box;\x22\x3e\x3cp style=\x22white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\x22\x3e\x3cstrong style=\x22box-sizing: border-box;\x22\x3e\x3cspan leaf=\x22\x22\x3e车灯“塑”造：四十年的以塑代玻\x3c/span\x3e\x3c/strong\x3e\x3c/p\x3e\x3c/section\x3e\x3c/section\x3e\x3c/section\x3e\x3csection style=\x22text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\x22\x3e\x3csection style=\x22background-color: rgb(184, 230, 236);height: 2px;box-sizing: border-box;\x22\x3e\x3csvg viewbox=\x220 0 1 1\x22 style=\x22float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\x22\x3e\x3c/svg\x3e\x3c/section\x3e\x3c/section\x3e\x3csection style=\x22font-size: 15px;box-sizing: border-box;\x22\x3e\x3cp style=\x22white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\x22\x3e\x3cspan leaf=\x22\x22\x3e早年的车灯是玻璃罩，又重又脆，造型自由度极低。转折发生在工程塑料成熟之后。今天拆开一只现代大灯来看，是塑料材料的一场大合唱。\x3c/span\x3e\x3c/p\x3e\x3cp style=\x22white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\x22\x3e\x3cspan leaf=\x22\x22\x3e\x3cbr /\x3e\x3c/span\x3e\x3c/p\x3e\x3c/section\x3e\x3csection style=\x22font-size: 15px;box-sizing: border-box;\x22\x3e\x3cp style=\x22white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\x22\x3e\x3cspan leaf=\x22\x22\x3e\x3cspan textstyle=\x22\x22 style=\x22color: rgb(28, 142, 171);font-weight: bold;\x22\x3e● 前照灯的核心\x3c/span\x3e——透镜和外配光镜（灯罩），主要用PC（聚碳酸酯）材料，它在车灯塑料材料中占比高达50%左右。此种材料的透光率约90%，抗冲击是玻璃的百倍级，能注塑出玻璃做不到的复合曲面，成为大灯的首选料。其缺点是不耐紫外线，必须加一层硅基硬化涂层——这几个微米厚的膜同时管抗刮与抗黄变，直接决定大灯寿命。靠近光源的高温位则用共聚PC（PC-HT），连续使用温度可到160℃级。\x3c/span\x3e\x3c/p\x3e\x3cp style=\x22white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\x22\x3e\x3cspan leaf=\x22\x22\x3e\x3cbr /\x3e\x3c/span\x3e\x3c/p\x3e\x3cp style=\x22white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\x22\x3e\x3cspan leaf=\x22\x22\x3e\x3cspan textstyle=\x22\x22 style=\x22color: rgb(28, 142, 171);font-weight: bold;\x22\x3e● PMMA\x3c/span\x3e（聚甲基丙烯酸甲酯，俗称有机玻璃、亚克力）的透光率可达90%-92%，耐候性和表面硬度俱佳，不施涂层也难发黄，但偏脆，所以只用在尾灯罩、导光条这些“不挨石子”的位置。近年它多了个理由：905nm激光雷达对PMMA的近红外透过性更友好。\x3c/span\x3e\x3c/p\x3e\x3cp style=\x22white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\x22\x3e\x3cspan leaf=\x22\x22\x3e\x3cbr /\x3e\x3c/span\x3e\x3c/p\x3e\x3c/section\x3e\x3csection style=\x22text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\x22\x3e\x3csection style=\x22max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\x22 nodeleaf=\x22\x22\x3e\x3cimg class=\x22rich_pages wxw-img\x22 data-aistatus=\x221\x22 data-imgfileid=\x22503442531\x22 data-ratio=\x220.75\x22 data-s=\x22300,640\x22 data-src=\x22https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/uCGBqVViboow1E96lvj0h8ctZ7nXjdMP0aVpTfaFJOCo7vEOYrChcq4ufLhMN1MvmMYXOTfDWk53ibB8yGEmzhrVstuyVGKIdSxoRXH6sFDzc/640?wx_fmt=png\x26amp;from=appmsg\x22 data-type=\x22png\x22 data-w=\x22540\x22 style=\x22vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\x22 /\x3e\x3c/section\x3e\x3c/section\x3e\x3csection style=\x22font-size: 15px;box-sizing: border-box;\x22\x3e\x3cp style=\x22white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\x22\x3e\x3cspan leaf=\x22\x22\x3e\x3cbr /\x3e\x3c/span\x3e\x3c/p\x3e\x3cp style=\x22white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\x22\x3e\x3cspan leaf=\x22\x22\x3e\x3cspan textstyle=\x22\x22 style=\x22color: rgb(28, 142, 171);font-weight: bold;\x22\x3e● 反射镜与饰圈：\x3c/span\x3e需要镜面级真空镀铝基材，PBT是常客，造型复杂处用耐高温PC，老阵地还有BMC/SMC。镀铝层仅0.1微米，反射率85%~90%。\x3c/span\x3e\x3c/p\x3e\x3cp style=\x22white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\x22\x3e\x3cspan leaf=\x22\x22\x3e\x3cbr /\x3e\x3c/span\x3e\x3c/p\x3e\x3cp style=\x22white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\x22\x3e\x3cspan leaf=\x22\x22\x3e\x3cspan textstyle=\x22\x22 style=\x22color: rgb(28, 142, 171);font-weight: bold;\x22\x3e● 而车灯的“骨架”\x3c/span\x3e——前照灯壳体，则以改性PP（聚丙烯）为主，占比约30%，性价比和耐化学性是它的核心优势。此外，PBT/PET用于饰圈和调节装置支架，ABS及PC/ABS合金用于尾灯壳体和饰板，玻纤增强PA66用于内部调节结构。\x3c/span\x3e\x3c/p\x3e\x3cp style=\x22white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\x22\x3e\x3cspan leaf=\x22\x22\x3e\x3cbr /\x3e\x3c/span\x3e\x3c/p\x3e\x3cp style=\x22white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\x22\x3e\x3cspan leaf=\x22\x22\x3e\x3cspan textstyle=\x22\x22 style=\x22color: rgb(28, 142, 171);font-weight: bold;\x22\x3e● 散热件：\x3c/span\x3eLED的光是“聚”的，过去此处必用压铸铝；如今导热塑料开始上位——导热系数只有铝的几十分之一，却能做成极复杂的超薄鳍片把表面积堆上去，还省掉了二次机加工。\x3c/span\x3e\x3c/p\x3e\x3cp style=\x22white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\x22\x3e\x3cspan leaf=\x22\x22\x3e\x3cbr /\x3e\x3c/span\x3e\x3c/p\x3e\x3c/section\x3e\x3csection style=\x22font-size: 15px;box-sizing: border-box;\x22\x3e\x3cp style=\x22white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\x22\x3e\x3cspan leaf=\x22\x22\x3e塑料在车灯中的价值不仅是“轻”和“便宜”。PC比玻璃减重约50%，PMMA的透光性能优于传统玻璃配光镜，而双色注塑等工艺让塑料件的设计自由度远超玻璃时代。根据行业分析，前照大灯的原材料成本中，塑胶材料占比达16%以上，是继电子元器件之后的第二大成本项。\x3c/span\x3e\x3c/p\x3e\x3c/section\x3e\x3csection style=\x22text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\x22\x3e\x3csection style=\x22max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\x22 nodeleaf=\x22\x22\x3e\x3cimg class=\x22rich_pages wxw-img\x22 data-aistatus=\x221\x22 data-imgfile